# lotus_pwm_led — umbrella-subsystem activation (option A).
#
# Assembly: 2x grove_pwm_led (PWM, pwm-leds). The rig's shields carry no
# Kconfig.defconfig of their own (only SHIELD_<NAME> identification
# symbols) — enabling the subsystems the instantiated shields' DRIVERS
# actually need is the rig's job, not the shield's or the expander's.
# LED is the umbrella the pwm-leds driver (drivers/led/led_pwm.c) sits
# under; PWM is the controller subsystem it drives through.
CONFIG_PWM=y
CONFIG_LED=y
